From a430b9192350b843d5202f80c9f6c1c8d7cc63cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gitman-101111 <development@spamfolder.xyz>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:23:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] nfc: add reMarkable's NXP CTN730 marker charger driver

The CTN730 NFC controller charges the marker (pen) wirelessly; the
driver loads its firmware, runs the charging protocol and reports the
marker battery as a power supply. Ported from reMarkable's linux-imx-rm
6.12 tree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
